      "description": "A little camera shop in your pocket.\n\nChoose a camera. Pick a lens. Load a roll. Every combination has its own look, baked live into the viewfinder before you ever press the shutter. No sliders, no presets to scroll: you compose the feel by choosing your gear, the way you would with real film.\n\nA roll is 36 shots, and there is always another: every film on the shelf is yours, roll after roll.\n\n• A real optical pipeline — body color science, lens character, and film stock, layered the way light actually stacks up\n• Live viewfinder preview: what you see is what develops\n• 100 film stocks, each with its own mood — pastel, golden, green, black & white and more\n• Everything is included — no ads, no subscription, no in-app purchases\n• Your photos stay on your device unless you post them to PHOTO PARADE. No account, no sign-in.\n\nShoot your day the way it felt.",
      "trackCensoredName": "ROLLIE'S: 35mm Film Camera",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/rollies-35mm-film-camera/id6805318319?uo=4",
