      "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+",
      "bundleId": "com.mayacrew.rollies",
      "releaseNotes": "New camera: Half Frame Single. No split screen: every press saves one tall photo. The two-shots-one-print Half Frame stays as it is.\nShare photos and movies from the album straight to other apps.\nThe album and PHOTO PARADE open faster, and photos to post are ready to pick without the wait.\nMovie mode has a new lens, the Fivefold 7-35: it starts at your phone's own view and zooms to 5×. Telephoto shots no longer show streaks along the top and bottom edges.\nFixed the app closing while an update was applied.",
